{
  "id": "ai_decision",
  "name": "AI Nerve / Demand Check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -170,
      "params": {
        "text": "AI decision-making: does a rival power follow through on a demand, or lose its nerve? (spec/systems/ai.md; nerve check ai_acts BYTE_VERIFIED sim/diplomacy.cpp.) restrained = (attitude>>2 > demand_score) AND (demand_score > 12) AND (random(0,4) != 0); the AI ACTS = not restrained. So a calm, cautious AI (high attitude toward you) with a big demand still backs down 4 times in 5. attitude>>2 is floor(attitude/4). Here power 1 (French) weighs a demand against player 0 (English): nerve holds -> Declare War + the real @DECLAREWAR message; nerve fails -> the @OLDPEACEMANLY 'we elect not to drive you' message. attitude/demand are contextual inputs (driven by rolls here); the formula + constants are inline, no magic-number nodes."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trig",
      "type": "OnTestFire",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 90,
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "att",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 250,
      "params": { "expr": "30 + roll(0,50)" }
    },
    {
      "id": "dem",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 330,
      "params": { "expr": "10 + roll(0,12)" }
    },
    {
      "id": "acts",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 250,
      "params": { "expr": "!( (floor(a/4) > b) && (b > 12) && (roll(0,4) != 0) )" }
    },
    {
      "id": "br",
      "type": "Branch",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 90,
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "natEng",
      "type": "GetState",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 410,
      "params": { "path": "@NATIONALITY[0].name" }
    },
    {
      "id": "natFr",
      "type": "GetState",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 480,
      "params": { "path": "@NATIONALITY[1].name" }
    },
    {
      "id": "war",
      "type": "DeclareWar",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 40,
      "params": { "a": "1", "b": "0" }
    },
    {
      "id": "warMsg",
      "type": "Notify",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "params": { "textKey": "@DECLAREWAR" }
    },
    {
      "id": "calmMsg",
      "type": "Notify",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 150,
      "params": { "textKey": "@OLDPEACEMANLY" }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": { "node": "trig", "pin": "out" }, "to": { "node": "br", "pin": "in" } },
    { "from": { "node": "att", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "acts", "pin": "a" } },
    { "from": { "node": "dem", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "acts", "pin": "b" } },
    { "from": { "node": "acts", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "br", "pin": "cond" } },
    { "from": { "node": "br", "pin": "true" }, "to": { "node": "war", "pin": "in" } },
    { "from": { "node": "war", "pin": "out" }, "to": { "node": "warMsg", "pin": "in" } },
    { "from": { "node": "br", "pin": "false" }, "to": { "node": "calmMsg", "pin": "in" } },
    { "from": { "node": "natEng", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "warMsg", "pin": "str0" } },
    { "from": { "node": "natFr", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "warMsg", "pin": "str1" } },
    { "from": { "node": "natEng", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "calmMsg", "pin": "str0" } },
    { "from": { "node": "natFr", "pin": "value" }, "to": { "node": "calmMsg", "pin": "str1" } }
  ]
}
